"""CSD1731xQ2 — TI 30 V N-channel NexFET power MOSFETs in WSON-6 (DQK) 2x2 mm.

Pin-compatible 30 V N-channel NexFETs sharing the DQK body. Select by
`current_rating` (silicon-limited continuous Id at T_C = 25 °C):

    current_rating   MPN            Carrier         R_DS(on) max @ 8 V
    --------------   ------------   -------------   ------------------
    5A               CSD17313Q2     3000 reel       30 mΩ
    5A               CSD17313Q2T    250 reel        30 mΩ
    25A              CSD17318Q2     3000 reel       15.1 mΩ
    25A              CSD17318Q2T    250 reel        15.1 mΩ

First row of the filtered block becomes the primary `part`; the remaining
row(s) become BOM alternatives (T = small-reel tape variant).

Both dice are logic-level (5 V gate drive) and share the DQK pinout:
pin 3 = G; pin 4 + small source pad 7 = S; pins 1, 2, 5, 6 + thermal pad
8 = D. The thermal pad is the drain — solder it for thermal and
electrical performance.
"""

load("@stdlib/units.zen", "Current")

# (mpn, symbol_name, current_rating) — filtered block's first row
# becomes part=; remaining rows become BOM alternatives.
_FAMILY = [
    ("CSD17313Q2", "CSD17313Q2", Current("5A")),
    ("CSD17313Q2T", "CSD17313Q2", Current("5A")),
    ("CSD17318Q2", "CSD17318Q2", Current("25A")),
    ("CSD17318Q2T", "CSD17318Q2", Current("25A")),
]

current_rating = config(
    Current,
    default="25A",
    allowed=["5A", "25A"],
    help="Silicon-limited continuous drain current (T_C = 25 °C). Selects the die.",
)

_matches = [(mpn, sym) for mpn, sym, i in _FAMILY if i == current_rating]
_parts = [Part(mpn=mpn, manufacturer="Texas Instruments") for mpn, _ in _matches]

D = io(Net)
G = io(Net)
S = io(Net)

Component(
    name="Q1",
    symbol=Symbol(library="CSD1731xQ2.kicad_sym", name=_matches[0][1]),
    part=_parts[0],
    properties={"alternatives": _parts[1:]},
    pins={
        "G": G,
        "D": D,
        "S": S,
    },
)
